# SINTRAN ERRFATAL evidence run (errfaprobe bitstream): boot bare '&',
# let the crash happen, then read the probe's repeating console line
#   EF <X> <T> <A> <D> <L>    (octal; ERRFA's entry saves)
# T decodes the failing Winchester-driver check: 0=HDERR (X=hw status)
# 1=MORER 4=MEMER 10=LAOUR 100=DILLC 200=CNACT.
LABEL boot SINTRAN via bare & (ALD default = Winchester)
SEND &
LABEL waiting for ERRFATAL
EXPECT 240 ERRFATAL
LABEL waiting for the P read-history line (~0.5 s after the crash text)
EXPECT 60 P [0-7]{6}
LABEL waiting for the EF evidence line
EXPECT 60 EF [0-7]{6}
PAUSE 10
